here surely is no secret agenda. Praise His Holy Name, the Pontiff General!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>IRON SANCTUARY is inspired by the genre defining IRON NEST and PVKK, the art direction of Dishonored and the atmosphere of BioShock.</i></p>", "short_description": "Conduct the IRON SANCTUARY. Devise your journey on the map, raise the miners for fuel, secure the valves, repair and maintain the mechanisms, save as many people as you can. Praised be the Pontiff General!", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Russian, German, French, Italian, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Spanish - Spain, Polish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4980400/cff545040979351983b576c8941d7f9dbdae861d/header.jpg?t=1786360975", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4980400/195acedba0c28e8ac126673dd21380624edf0f4b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786360975", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4980400/195acedba0c28e8ac126673dd21380624edf0f4b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786360975", "website": "https://impress.games/press-kit/mugur-eugen-colin/iron-sanctuary", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD / AMD Vega 8<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><l